    <!-- UNCERTAIN_MI：长段尽力翻译，需母语者复核 -->
    <string name="thanks_mp_desc">E whakamahi ana tēnei taupānga i a MP-Manager hei tauira: te tirotiro papa-rua me ngā mahi whakawhiti-papa (tārua, nuku, whakapiri ki tērā atu papa); te āhua o ngā rārangi kōnae — ngā ata tapawhā porotaka iti, ngā ingoa me te tapanga \'rā + rahi\'; te tahua ⋮ o ia rārangi me te paewhiri \'Ētahi atu kōwhiringa\' e iwa; te tukanga ipu para me ngā pouaka whakaū whakaora me te muku tūturu; te pouaka hanga; te ētita kuputuhi me ngā tau rārangi me te pae tohu; te ipu para, ngā tohuwāhi me ngā kōpaki kua titiia; te urunga Shizuku/pakiaka; te kōpeketanga me te tangohanga, te whakamunatanga me te wetekinatanga o ngā kōnae; me ngā rokiroki ā-roto kua whakaritea. Ngā mihi ki a MP-Manager mō te noho hei pūmanawa tuwhera i raro i te GPL-3.0 i GitHub (https://github.com/AbdurazaaqMohammed/MP-Manager), mō te hoatu i tētahi tauira hoahoa i taea e tēnei taupānga te ako me te whai tōtika, ā, ngā mihi ki tōna kaituhi a AbdurazaaqMohammed mō te tiaki tonu i a ia, me te whakaatu ka taea e te tangata noa te hanga i tētahi kōwhiringa tuwhera pai mō MT Manager.</string>
    <!-- UNCERTAIN_MI：长段尽力翻译，需母语者复核 -->
    <string name="thanks_mt_desc">E whakamahi ana tēnei taupānga i te tahora papa-rua, ngā tahua kōnae, te paewhiri \'Ētahi atu kōwhiringa\' e iwa, me ngā pouaka mukunga/whakaora o MT Manager hei tauira hoahoa. Ngā mihi ki a MT Manager mō te tauira hoahoa me te whakaaweawe.</string>
    <!-- UNCERTAIN_MI：长段尽力翻译，需母语者复核 -->
    <string name="thanks_muse_desc">Ngā mihi ki a Muse mō te āwhina whanaketanga me te tautoko hangarau: nā Muse i āwhina te tuhi waehere, te whakatinanatanga o ngā āhuatanga, me te rapurongoā o tēnei taupānga.</string>
